<p>Some regional digipeaters also report live weather data alongside their normal digipeating function. This page covers the additions on top of a standard WIDEn-N configuration.</p>

<p>See <a href="/widen-n-digipeater/" class="text-signal-600 underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-signal-500">WIDEn-N Digipeater</a> for the base configuration this builds on.</p>
